@base = http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. Available resources from 09:00 to 11:00
GET {{base}}/resources/available?start=2026-12-15T09:00:00&end=2026-12-15T11:00:00

### 2. Book Boardroom (id 1)
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "memberId":1,
    "resourceId":1,
    "startDateTime":"2026-12-15T09:00:00",
    "endDateTime":"2026-12-15T11:00:00",
    "attendees":4
}

### 3. Overlapping availability search 
GET {{base}}/resources/available?start=2026-12-15T10:00:00&end=2026-12-15T12:00:00

### 4. Adjacent availability search 
GET {{base}}/resources/available?start=2026-12-15T11:00:00&end=2026-12-15T12:00:00

### 5. Meeting room with capacity of at least 5
GET {{base}}/resources/available?start=2026-12-15T13:00:00&end=2026-12-15T14:00:00&type=MEETING_ROOM&minCapacity=5

### 6. Invalid time interval (expect 400)
GET {{base}}/resources/available?start=2026-12-15T12:00:00&end=2026-12-15T10:00:00

### 7. Missing end time (expect 400)
GET {{base}}/resources/available?start=2026-12-15T09:00:00

### 8. Invalid resource type (expect 400)
GET {{base}}/resources/available?start=2026-12-15T09:00:00&end=2026-12-15T11:00:00&type=SOFA
